alf-feedback-transformer — NOTICE

This directory (apps/alf-feedback-transformer/) is a CPU-only toy of:

  Xuyuan Xiong, Siyu Chen, Mengzhao Chen, Yue Su, Zhuoran Yang, Ping Luo,
  Xihui Liu, "Attention Latent Feedback", arXiv:2611.31154.
  https://arxiv.org/abs/2611.31154
  https://arxiv.org/html/2611.31154

Found via a bookmarked X post by @rosinality. The post was not fetched.
The bookmark text was checked against the arXiv abstract and HTML.

Official code (MIT, not vendored, no source files copied):
  https://github.com/xjxyys/ALF
  Project page: https://xjxyys.github.io/attention-latent-feedback/

The toy reimplements the published standard-residual equations (3.1)–(3.8)
and the FBT input fusion described with that code (gate product, unit RMS,
no prefix mixin, no jitter). It does not use Marin, JAX, or the MoE ladder.
No paper figures are copied. Trained weights stay out of git (work/ is
git-ignored).
